[138.67964, "i", "riginal instruction governs only where it is left alone. The draft returned addressed to the wrong parent's attorney, so I weighed each line against the record rather than sending any wording that has not been checked. Where a line follows the governing instruction, it is verified; where it takes a different position, a narrower position, or names the wrong person, it is at odds with the record; where neither message speaks to the subject, the record is silent and the line is not in the record at all.\n\nLetter lines at odds with the record: {counts['AT_ODDS']}\n\nThe table in `letter_line_review.csv` gives the verdict and governing entry for each draft line, and `results.json` carries the four totals: lines verified, lines at odds with the record, lines not in the record at all, and lines whose governing entry comes from the clarification rather than the original. This review is final as to the record supplied; no line was accepted merely because it read reasonably, and every line was weighed against the entry t"]
